{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/debug-laravel-app/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Yerin Blog"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"38faa01b-682b-5e71-8956-5804d5d4aa7f","excerpt":"1. Laravel Debugbar 1.1 Add requirement 1.2 Change config 1.3 Publish ### 1.4 Check  1.5 Clear cache & config ## 2. Xdebug + VS code + macOS + MAMP 2.1 Install…","html":"<h2>1. Laravel Debugbar</h2>\n<h3>1.1 Add requirement</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">$ php composer.phar require barryvdh/laravel-debugbar <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--dev</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3>1.2 Change config</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"php\"><pre class=\"language-php\"><code class=\"language-php\">diff <span class=\"token operator\">--</span>git a<span class=\"token operator\">/</span>config<span class=\"token operator\">/</span>app<span class=\"token operator\">.</span>php b<span class=\"token operator\">/</span>config<span class=\"token operator\">/</span>app<span class=\"token operator\">.</span>php\nindex <span class=\"token number\">3</span>c5820c4<span class=\"token operator\">.</span><span class=\"token number\">.8</span>ddaee54 <span class=\"token number\">100644</span>\n<span class=\"token operator\">--</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span> a<span class=\"token operator\">/</span>config<span class=\"token operator\">/</span>app<span class=\"token operator\">.</span>php\n<span class=\"token operator\">++</span><span class=\"token operator\">+</span> b<span class=\"token operator\">/</span>config<span class=\"token operator\">/</span>app<span class=\"token operator\">.</span>php\n@@ <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">200</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"token number\">6</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span><span class=\"token number\">200</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"token number\">10</span> @@ <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n \n         <span class=\"token class-name class-name-fully-qualified static-context\">App<span class=\"token punctuation\">\\</span>Providers<span class=\"token punctuation\">\\</span>GoogleDriveServiceProvider</span><span class=\"token operator\">::</span><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n \n<span class=\"token operator\">+</span>        <span class=\"token comment\">/*\n+         * Laravel Debugbar\n+         */</span>\n<span class=\"token operator\">+</span>        <span class=\"token class-name class-name-fully-qualified static-context\">Barryvdh<span class=\"token punctuation\">\\</span>Debugbar<span class=\"token punctuation\">\\</span>ServiceProvider</span><span class=\"token operator\">::</span><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n     <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n \n     <span class=\"token comment\">/*\n@@ -258,6 +262,10 @@ return [\n         'Excel'        => Maatwebsite\\Excel\\Facades\\Excel::class,\n         'PDF'          => Barryvdh\\DomPDF\\Facade::class,\n \n+        /*\n+         * Debugbar Aliases\n+         */</span>\n<span class=\"token operator\">+</span>        <span class=\"token string single-quoted-string\">'Debugbar'</span>     <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token class-name class-name-fully-qualified static-context\">Barryvdh<span class=\"token punctuation\">\\</span>Debugbar<span class=\"token punctuation\">\\</span>Facade</span><span class=\"token operator\">::</span><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n     <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n \n <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3>1.3 Publish</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">$ php artisan vendor:publish <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--provider</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Barryvdh\\Debugbar\\ServiceProvider\"</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>### 1.4 Check <code class=\"language-text\">.env</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"ini\"><pre class=\"language-ini\"><code class=\"language-ini\"><span class=\"token key attr-name\">APP_DEBUG</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span><span class=\"token value attr-value\">true</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3>1.5 Clear cache &#x26; config</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">$ php artisan cache:clear\n$ php artisan config:cache</code></pre></div>\n<p>## 2. Xdebug + VS code + macOS + MAMP</p>\n<h3>2.1 Install Xdebug extension on VSCode</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">pecl <span class=\"token function\">install</span> xdebug</code></pre></div>\n<p>But if you use MAMP, you don’t need to install xdebug via pecl since MAMP already has xdebug.so file.\nxdebug.so path: <code class=\"language-text\">/Applications/MAMP/bin/php/php7.3.33/lib/php/extensions/no-debug-non-zts-20180731/xdebug.so</code></p>\n<h3>2.2 Add the below code on php.ini</h3>\n<p>php.ini path: <code class=\"language-text\">/Applications/MAMP/bin/php/php7.3.33/conf/php.ini</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"ini\"><pre class=\"language-ini\"><code class=\"language-ini\"><span class=\"token section\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token section-name selector\">xdebug</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"token key attr-name\">zend_extension</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span><span class=\"token value attr-value\">\"<span class=\"token inner-value\">/Applications/MAMP/bin/php/php7.3.33/lib/php/extensions/no-debug-non-zts-20180731/xdebug.so</span>\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key attr-name\">xdebug.mode</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span> <span class=\"token value attr-value\">debug$</span>\n<span class=\"token key attr-name\">xdebug.log</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span> <span class=\"token value attr-value\">/tmp/xdebug.log$</span>\n<span class=\"token key attr-name\">xdebug.client_port</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span> <span class=\"token value attr-value\">9003</span>\n<span class=\"token key attr-name\">xdebug.remote_enable</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span><span class=\"token value attr-value\">1</span>\n<span class=\"token key attr-name\">xdebug.remote_host</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span><span class=\"token value attr-value\">127.0.0.1</span>\n<span class=\"token key attr-name\">xdebug.remote_connect_back</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span><span class=\"token value attr-value\">1</span>\n<span class=\"token key attr-name\">xdebug.remote_port</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span><span class=\"token value attr-value\">9003</span>\n<span class=\"token key attr-name\">xdebug.remote_handler</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span><span class=\"token value attr-value\">dbgp</span>\n<span class=\"token key attr-name\">xdebug.remote_mode</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span><span class=\"token value attr-value\">req</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3>2.3 VS settings</h3>\n<p>PHP settings.json<br>\n<span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/c44b4dad2db8aa8ca3124a6ce610b273/76a18/vs_php_settings.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 38.60759493670886%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"vs_php_settings\"\n        title=\"vs_php_settings\"\n        src=\"/static/c44b4dad2db8aa8ca3124a6ce610b273/f058b/vs_php_settings.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/c44b4dad2db8aa8ca3124a6ce610b273/c26ae/vs_php_settings.png 158w,\n/static/c44b4dad2db8aa8ca3124a6ce610b273/6bdcf/vs_php_settings.png 315w,\n/static/c44b4dad2db8aa8ca3124a6ce610b273/f058b/vs_php_settings.png 630w,\n/static/c44b4dad2db8aa8ca3124a6ce610b273/40601/vs_php_settings.png 945w,\n/static/c44b4dad2db8aa8ca3124a6ce610b273/78612/vs_php_settings.png 1260w,\n/static/c44b4dad2db8aa8ca3124a6ce610b273/76a18/vs_php_settings.png 1691w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add php executable path: <code class=\"language-text\">/Applications/MAMP/bin/php/php7.3.33/bin/php</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/71d4b3df43d1fc4ca790fe693165bef6/90712/settings.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 51.26582278481012%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"settings\"\n        title=\"settings\"\n        src=\"/static/71d4b3df43d1fc4ca790fe693165bef6/f058b/settings.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/71d4b3df43d1fc4ca790fe693165bef6/c26ae/settings.png 158w,\n/static/71d4b3df43d1fc4ca790fe693165bef6/6bdcf/settings.png 315w,\n/static/71d4b3df43d1fc4ca790fe693165bef6/f058b/settings.png 630w,\n/static/71d4b3df43d1fc4ca790fe693165bef6/90712/settings.png 882w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"json\"><pre class=\"language-json\"><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"token property\">\"php.validate.executablePath\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"/Applications/MAMP/bin/php/php7.3.33/bin/php\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n<span class=\"token property\">\"php.debug.executablePath\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"/Applications/MAMP/bin/php/php7.3.33/bin/php\"</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>VS launch.json</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"json\"><pre class=\"language-json\"><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\">// Use IntelliSense to learn about possible attributes.</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\">// Hover to view descriptions of existing attributes.</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\">// For more information, visit: https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=830387</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">\"version\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"0.2.0\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">\"configurations\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token property\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Listen for Xdebug\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token property\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"php\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token property\">\"request\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"launch\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token property\">\"hostname\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"127.0.0.1\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token property\">\"port\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">9003</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token property\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Launch currently open script\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token property\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"php\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token property\">\"request\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"launch\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token property\">\"program\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"${file}\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token property\">\"cwd\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"${fileDirname}\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token property\">\"port\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">9003</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3>2.4 Run Xdebug on VSCode</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Run server on MAMP</li>\n<li>Run Xdebug on VSCode</li>\n<li>Set breakpoint on VSCode</li>\n<li>Access to the page on browser</li>\n<li>VSCode will stop on breakpoint</li>\n<li>You can check the variable on VSCode</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 513px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/fccbc06ff710a70a40ed455fcf2cd547/267f6/debug_screen.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 262.0253164556962%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"debug_screen\"\n        title=\"debug_screen\"\n        src=\"/static/fccbc06ff710a70a40ed455fcf2cd547/267f6/debug_screen.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/fccbc06ff710a70a40ed455fcf2cd547/c26ae/debug_screen.png 158w,\n/static/fccbc06ff710a70a40ed455fcf2cd547/6bdcf/debug_screen.png 315w,\n/static/fccbc06ff710a70a40ed455fcf2cd547/267f6/debug_screen.png 513w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 513px) 100vw, 513px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<h3>2.5 Troubleshooting</h3>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/530bddc8bedf42554a5eea624133413b/daf05/already_used_port.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 56.9620253164557%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"already_used_port\"\n        title=\"already_used_port\"\n        src=\"/static/530bddc8bedf42554a5eea624133413b/f058b/already_used_port.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/530bddc8bedf42554a5eea624133413b/c26ae/already_used_port.png 158w,\n/static/530bddc8bedf42554a5eea624133413b/6bdcf/already_used_port.png 315w,\n/static/530bddc8bedf42554a5eea624133413b/f058b/already_used_port.png 630w,\n/static/530bddc8bedf42554a5eea624133413b/40601/already_used_port.png 945w,\n/static/530bddc8bedf42554a5eea624133413b/78612/already_used_port.png 1260w,\n/static/530bddc8bedf42554a5eea624133413b/daf05/already_used_port.png 2672w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Find the process which uses the port 9003</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\">$ <span class=\"token function\">netstat</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-anv</span> <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> <span class=\"token function\">grep</span> <span class=\"token number\">9003</span>\ntcp4       <span class=\"token number\">0</span>      <span class=\"token number\">0</span>  <span class=\"token number\">127.0</span>.0.1.9003         <span class=\"token number\">127.0</span>.0.1.49477        ESTABLISHED  <span class=\"token number\">408157</span>  <span class=\"token number\">146988</span>   <span class=\"token number\">1291</span>      <span class=\"token number\">0</span> 00102 00000004 0000000000002cb7 00000081 01000900      <span class=\"token number\">1</span>      <span class=\"token number\">0</span> 000001\ntcp4       <span class=\"token number\">0</span>      <span class=\"token number\">0</span>  <span class=\"token number\">127.0</span>.0.1.49477        <span class=\"token number\">127.0</span>.0.1.9003         ESTABLISHED  <span class=\"token number\">408193</span>  <span class=\"token number\">146988</span>    <span class=\"token number\">864</span>      <span class=\"token number\">0</span> 00102 00000000 0000000000002cb6 00000081 00000900      <span class=\"token number\">1</span>      <span class=\"token number\">0</span> 000001\ntcp4       <span class=\"token number\">0</span>      <span class=\"token number\">0</span>  <span class=\"token number\">127.0</span>.0.1.9003         *.*                    LISTEN       <span class=\"token number\">131072</span>  <span class=\"token number\">131072</span>   <span class=\"token number\">1291</span>      <span class=\"token number\">0</span> 00000 00000006 0000000000002c7a 000000           <span class=\"token number\">0</span> c53d8</code></pre></div>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li>Kill the process</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\">$ <span class=\"token function\">kill</span> <span class=\"token number\">864</span>\n$ <span class=\"token function\">kill</span> <span class=\"token number\">1291</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>$ kill -9 408157\n$ kill -9 408193</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://medium.com/@alirazalilani/debugging-php-laravel-with-visual-studio-code-37b756fb6c19/\">https://medium.com/@alirazalilani/debugging-php-laravel-with-visual-studio-code-37b756fb6c19/</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://5balloons.info/setting-up-xdebug-using-laravel-valet-and-vscode/\">https://5balloons.info/setting-up-xdebug-using-laravel-valet-and-vscode/</a></li>\n</ul>","frontmatter":{"title":"Debug laravel app","date":"May 09, 2023","description":null}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/magento-mac-setup-apache/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Setup Magento 2 with Apache on MacOS"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/colab-getting-started-vscode/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Getting started with colab + vscode"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"38faa01b-682b-5e71-8956-5804d5d4aa7f","previousPostId":"ad03da7d-e832-5af2-bcfa-c5ba534ad03e","nextPostId":"d379257a-b574-5eeb-8d71-676eee86db7f"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2841359383","3257411868"]}